    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072660/extras/9ab220d9c8913f400d27c279138d1164.avif?t=1743180138\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><strong>Will you stay close to safety and see where the journey leads, or will you venture further to find answers and risk it all?</strong><br><br>Ex Nihilo is a non-linear, narrative driven sci-fi adventure with a touch of cosmic horror.<br><br>You awaken in a pod. You have been taken. <br>But by whom? And where are you headed?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072660/extras/159ad7ccbd976ba6d4097d92ce5ca82a.poster.avif?t=1743180138\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072660/extras/159ad7ccbd976ba6d4097d92ce5ca82a.webm?t=1743180138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072660/extras/159ad7ccbd976ba6d4097d92ce5ca82a.mp4?t=1743180138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>On your journey through an interconnected world, time is limited. <br>You have just ten days to escape before reaching your final destination.<br><br>But stray from your pod for too long, and strange beings begin to appear\u2026<br><strong>And they have their eye on you.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072660/extras/3e48c3643a8671aa6e134d2c0c5771bd.poster.avif?t=1743180138\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072660/extras/3e48c3643a8671aa6e134d2c0c5771bd.webm?t=1743180138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072660/extras/3e48c3643a8671aa6e134d2c0c5771bd.mp4?t=1743180138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Squint your eyes to avoid detection and make your way back to safety.<br>Reawaken, to find yourself one day further from home, with less time to escape \u2026",
